            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#6a645c' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Source: World Athletics season top lists (every performance, top 500 a season), scraped October 2026. Elite means under 2:07 / 2:24 in the marathon and 60:00 / 67:00 in the half. &apos;New faces&apos; counts a runner&apos;s first elite marathon since 2001, so the first few years include some who&apos;d done it before. 2026 left out as it isn&apos;t finished. The course down the side is just for fun, it isn&apos;t a real route.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
